OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry day with just the
OL,6,Fodd brief light shower. Staying mostly
OL,7,Fcloudy too with just a few bright
OL,8,Fintervals.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be a cloudy but
OL,11,Fmainly dry evening. Remaining cloudy
OL,12,Fovernight with a few showers
OL,13,Fdeveloping, mainly over Orkney later.
OL,14,FNorthwesterly winds easing.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FA mixture of bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells and a few brief showers. Light
OL,18,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
